---
config:
  theme: dark
id: serialization-storage-04
title: Infrastructure Layer (Serialization, Storage, Encryption)
---
classDiagram
    direction TB

    %% Concrete implementations of the service abstractions, plus the type-binder
    %% safety net for JSON deserialization and the cross-layer logging utility.

    namespace ServiceAbstractions {
        class ISerializer {
            <<interface>>
            +Serialize~T~(T) string
            +Deserialize~T~(string) T
        }

        class IStorageProvider {
            <<interface>>
            +WriteAsync(...) Task
            +ReadAsync(...) Task~string~
            +Exists(...) bool
            +GetLastWriteTimeUtc(...) DateTime?
            +DeleteProfile(...) void
        }

        class IEncryptionProvider {
            <<interface>>
            +Encrypt(string) string
            +Decrypt(string) string
        }
    }

    namespace Infrastructure {
        class JsonSerializer {
            -JsonSerializerSettings _settings
            -SafeTypeBinder _binder
            +SafeTypeBinder Binder
            +Serialize~T~(T) string
            +Deserialize~T~(string) T
        }

        class SafeTypeBinder {
            <<ISerializationBinder>>
            -Dictionary~string, Type~ _aliasToType
            -Dictionary~Type, string~ _typeToAlias
            +Register~T~(string alias) void
            +BindToName(...) void
            +BindToType(...) Type
        }

        class SaveDataAliasAttribute {
            <<Attribute>>
            +string Alias
        }

        class LocalStorageProvider {
            -string _basePath
            +WriteAsync(...) Task
            +ReadAsync(...) Task~string~
            +GetLastWriteTimeUtc(...) DateTime?
            +DeleteProfile(...) void
            +Exists(...) bool
        }

        class AESProvider {
            -KeyMaterial _material
            +Encrypt(string) string
            +Decrypt(string) string
        }
    }

    namespace Common {
        class DebugLog {
            <<static>>
            +Log(string)$
            +Success(string)$
            +Warning(string)
            +Error(string)
            +SanitizePath(string) string$
            +SanitizeException(Exception) string$
        }
    }

    %% Implementation relationships.
    JsonSerializer ..|> ISerializer : implements
    LocalStorageProvider ..|> IStorageProvider : implements
    AESProvider ..|> IEncryptionProvider : implements

    %% Type-binder integration with serializer.
    JsonSerializer *-- SafeTypeBinder : composes (auto-scan on init)
    SafeTypeBinder ..> SaveDataAliasAttribute : reads aliases

    %% Logging usage (utility cross-cuts the layer).
    LocalStorageProvider ..> DebugLog : logs
    AESProvider ..> DebugLog : logs
    SafeTypeBinder ..> DebugLog : logs

    note for SafeTypeBinder "Whitelist-based binder.<br/>Auto-scans loaded assemblies for<br/>ISaveData / ISaveMeta / [SaveDataAlias].<br/>Blocks type-injection attacks (RCE)<br/>and survives class renames."

    note for LocalStorageProvider "Atomic write via temp+rename.<br/>Path-traversal validation.<br/>PlatformNotSupportedException<br/>on WebGL / console — user must<br/>supply custom IStorageProvider."

    note for AESProvider "AES-256-CBC + HMAC-SHA256<br/>(Encrypt-then-MAC).<br/>Two-key derivation via HMAC KDF.<br/>Constant-time tag comparison."

    note for DebugLog "Log / Success: stripped in non-Editor builds.<br/>Warning / Error: always on.<br/>SanitizePath / SanitizeException:<br/>return basename / .Message in builds<br/>to avoid leaking PII via crash reporters."
